LICENSE STATUS — UNDECIDED (pending provenance audit, see docs/provenance.md)

This repository intentionally does NOT claim any license yet.

Most of the routing data in data/seed_all_tunisia_routes.json is derived from
Tunismapper (see docs/provenance.md). The license and redistribution terms of
that source have not been verified. Until that is resolved, no license is
asserted for the dataset or for the repository as a whole.

Decisions needed before a license can be chosen:
- Contact Tunismapper to clarify terms, or replace that data with licensable
  sources (Transtu PDFs, SNCFT, OSM under ODbL, or own field data).
- Choose a license for the code (for example MIT, Apache-2.0, or GPL) once the
  data provenance is settled.

See docs/provenance.md for the current provenance audit.
